  message: "Fixed in WIP PR. Updated tracker cli.py:781 gate-message to print 'tracker discuss <id> \"<your reply>\" --ack-thread' (message before flag) — the working order. Argparse's nargs=? positional + following optional flag rejects flag-before-positional. Two new tests: gate message shows working order (anti-regression), and broken order still rejected by argparse."  # 2a6e
